Dear NILFS users,

We have released nilfs-2.0.6, which is a minor release to follow
kernel 2.6.28 and fix a cleanerd problem that occurs on volumes with
numerous snapshots.

We still have a few GC related problems to be solved, but I will
release this not to make a long blank period from the latest kernel
release.

The updated package can be found at:
http://www.nilfs.org/en/download.html

